<title>FRANCE: Elf holders approve production unit merger.</title>
<headline>Elf holders approve production unit merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French energy group Elf Aquitaine said on Wednesday that its shareholders had approved the merger of its Elf Aquitaine Production unit into Elf Aquitaine.</p>
<p>Approval was granted on Wednesday at an extraordinary shareholders' meeting, Elf said.</p>
<p>&quot;The decision was made in order to respond to changing conditions in certain sectors of Elf's exploration-production operations whose original structures are not presently adapted for the future,&quot; Elf said in a statement.</p>
<p>Elf unions had opposed the restructuring on grounds it would lead to job losses.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
